    printf(EXEC_NAME " Copyright (C) 2008-2010, 2012, 2013, 2017, 2019"

           "Matt Davis (enferex)\n"

           "Special thanks to all contributors and the 757 crew.\n"

           "This program comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY\n"

